# Keep the build context small: the target directory is by far the largest thing
# in the tree and is never useful inside the image.
/target
/data
/tests/fixtures/media
.git
# Neither CI definitions nor prose can affect the image, but either one landing in
# the context changes the digest `COPY . .` is keyed on — and that buys a full cold
# rebuild on both architectures for a typo fix.
/.github
*.md
.env
*.key
